    "detailed_description": "Bloody Hallowfest is a horror game with a retro visual style, inspired by some classic B-series horror films from the 90s.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797060/extras/e2d41c965b29f2ac9a5acb5732b14bed.avif?t=1751019411\" /></div><br><br>On the night before Halloween, Maya and her friends gather at the summer camp, eager to set up a special event for the youngsters. Together, they deck out the place and prepare games for Halloween night (kids love hunting for pumpkins and taking a swing at the pinata filled with sweets and candies!). What starts as a fun night takes a horrifying turn when a stranger, wielding a bloodied axe, barges in and snuffs out everyone's lives.<br><br>Now, Maya is forced to run for her life. As she unravels the escape plan, she also delves into a sinister secret behind the killer and the motives that led to such a massacre. Will Maya manage to escape the nightmare and confront the truth, or perhaps her blood will mingle with that of her friends on the cold steel of the killer's axe?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797060/extras/dcfa6ddf522937575886db4c21983402.poster.avif?t=1751019411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797060/extras/dcfa6ddf522937575886db4c21983402.webm?t=1751019411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797060/extras/dcfa6ddf522937575886db4c21983402.mp4?t=1751019411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Survive the Night: Help Maya navigate through the terrors of the night and escape the bloodbath.<br></li><li>Unravel the Mystery: Uncover the sinister secret behind the killer and the motives that led to such a massacre.<br></li><li>Prepare for Halloween: Immerse yourself in the Halloween spirit by helping set up decorations and games for the night.<br></li><li>Retro Graphics: Experience the nostalgia of classic B-series horror films with the game's retro visual style.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Bloody Hallowfest is a horror game with a retro visual style, inspired by some classic B-series horror films from the 90s.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797060/extras/e2d41c965b29f2ac9a5acb5732b14bed.avif?t=1751019411\" /></div><br><br>On the night before Halloween, Maya and her friends gather at the summer camp, eager to set up a special event for the youngsters. Together, they deck out the place and prepare games for Halloween night (kids love hunting for pumpkins and taking a swing at the pinata filled with sweets and candies!). What starts as a fun night takes a horrifying turn when a stranger, wielding a bloodied axe, barges in and snuffs out everyone's lives.<br><br>Now, Maya is forced to run for her life. As she unravels the escape plan, she also delves into a sinister secret behind the killer and the motives that led to such a massacre. Will Maya manage to escape the nightmare and confront the truth, or perhaps her blood will mingle with that of her friends on the cold steel of the killer's axe?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797060/extras/dcfa6ddf522937575886db4c21983402.poster.avif?t=1751019411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797060/extras/dcfa6ddf522937575886db4c21983402.webm?t=1751019411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797060/extras/dcfa6ddf522937575886db4c21983402.mp4?t=1751019411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Survive the Night: Help Maya navigate through the terrors of the night and escape the bloodbath.<br></li><li>Unravel the Mystery: Uncover the sinister secret behind the killer and the motives that led to such a massacre.<br></li><li>Prepare for Halloween: Immerse yourself in the Halloween spirit by helping set up decorations and games for the night.<br></li><li>Retro Graphics: Experience the nostalgia of classic B-series horror films with the game's retro visual style.</li></ul>",
